eleportation) is rooted in the principle of movement.<br></li><li> Spirit character management during combat. From a gamer's point of view, you can think of it as a pet. Attack synergy between it and the hero</li></ul><br><strong>Caravanserai Management</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Manage a guesthouse in the middle of the desert. Welcome guests and try to meet their needs<br></li><li> A feeling of daily life, where you improve your cocoon, and take pleasure, even when doing nothing and lazing around.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1243550?t=1754017702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754017702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754017702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754017702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1754017702\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243550/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1754017702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/